IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `spr-part8-credits-3`

-- Tests for regulations 34 to 39 (spr-part8-credits-3.l4).
-- Expected values are decided from the text of the regulation named beside each
-- group, before running. Tax years are named by the calendar year they start in (F3).

§ `Fixtures for regulation 34`
`partner of the person awarded child benefit, all conditions met` MEANS ChildBenefitCreditFacts WITH
    `the person is awarded child benefit for any part of the week in respect of a child under the age of 12` IS FALSE
    `the person is the partner of a person to whom child benefit is awarded for the week` IS TRUE
    `the person resides with the person to whom child benefit is awarded` IS TRUE
    `the person shares responsibility with that person for the child in respect of whom child benefit is awarded` IS TRUE
    `the person is ordinarily resident in Great Britain` IS TRUE
    `the person is undergoing imprisonment or detention in legal custody` IS FALSE
    `the person makes an application to the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs to be so credited in accordance with regulation 39` IS TRUE
    `all the earnings factors of the person to whom child benefit is awarded for the year` IS 6000
    `of those, the earnings factors derived from contributions credited by virtue of that person being awarded child benefit` IS 0
    `the qualifying earnings factor for the year` IS 5000

