    `the person resides with the person to whom child benefit is awarded` IS FALSE
    `the person shares responsibility with that person for the child in respect of whom child benefit is awarded` IS FALSE
    `the person is ordinarily resident in Great Britain` IS FALSE
    `the person is undergoing imprisonment or detention in legal custody` IS FALSE
