§ `Regulation 38`

-- (1)(a): 12 weeks before the date of becoming entitled (1 June 2027).
#ASSERT (`regulation 38(1): the period of 12 weeks` `before the person becomes entitled to carer's allowance or the carer support payment component of carer support` (YMD 2027 6 1))'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2027 3 9
#ASSERT (`regulation 38(1): the period of 12 weeks` `before the person becomes entitled to carer's allowance or the carer support payment component of carer support` (YMD 2027 6 1))'s `last day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2027 5 31
-- (1)(b), (c): 12 weeks after the end of the week in which entitlement or caring ceases (Saturday 5 June 2027).
#ASSERT (`regulation 38(1): the period of 12 weeks` `after the week in which the person ceases to be entitled to carer's allowance or the carer support payment component of carer support` (YMD 2027 6 5))'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2027 6 6
#ASSERT (`regulation 38(1): the period of 12 weeks` `after the week in which the person ceases to be entitled to carer's allowance or the carer support payment component of carer support` (YMD 2027 6 5))'s `last day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2027 8 28
#ASSERT (`regulation 38(1): the period of 12 weeks` `after the week in which regulation 37(2)(a) ceases to be satisfied` (YMD 2027 6 5))'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2027 6 6
#ASSERT (`regulation 38(1): the period of 12 weeks` `after the week in which regulation 37(2)(a) ceases to be satisfied` (YMD 2027 6 5))'s `last day of the period` EQUALS YMD 2027 8 28
-- The period is 84 days.
#ASSERT `the number of days from` ((`regulation 38(1): the period of 12 weeks` `after the week in which regulation 37(2)(a) ceases to be satisfied` (YMD 2027 6 5))'s `first day of the period`) ((`regulation 38(1): the period of 12 weeks` `after the week in which regulation 37(2)(a) ceases to be satisfied` (YMD 2027 6 5))'s `last day of the period`) EQUALS 83
-- Days inside and outside.
