§ `Regulation 39`
`week in 2025, received on the last day of the following tax year` MEANS ApplicationTimeFacts WITH
    `the kind of application` IS `an application under regulation 34(1)(b), 36 or 37`
    `the first day of a week which is the subject of the application` IS YMD 2025 10 6
    `the date the application is received` IS YMD 2027 4 5
    `the last day of any further time that the Secretary of State or the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs consider reasonable in the circumstances` IS NOTHING

`week in 2025, received a day later` MEANS ApplicationTimeFacts WITH
    `the kind of application` IS `an application under regulation 34(1)(b), 36 or 37`
    `the first day of a week which is the subject of the application` IS YMD 2025 10 6
    `the date the application is received` IS YMD 2027 4 6
    `the last day of any further time that the Secretary of State or the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs consider reasonable in the circumstances` IS NOTHING

`week in 2025, received within the first following year` MEANS ApplicationTimeFacts WITH
    `the kind of application` IS `an application under regulation 34(1)(b), 36 or 37`
    `the first day of a week which is the subject of the application` IS YMD 2025 10 6
    `the date the application is received` IS YMD 2026 4 6
    `the last day of any further time that the Secretary of State or the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs consider reasonable in the circumstances` IS NOTHING

`week in 2025, received late with a further time allowed to 31 Dec 2027` MEANS ApplicationTimeFacts WITH
    `the kind of application` IS `an application under regulation 34(1)(b), 36 or 37`
    `the first day of a week which is the subject of the application` IS YMD 2025 10 6
    `the date the application is received` IS YMD 2027 12 31
    `the last day of any further time that the Secretary of State or the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs consider reasonable in the circumstances` IS JUST (YMD 2027 12 31)

`week in 2025, received after a further time allowed to 31 Dec 2027` MEANS ApplicationTimeFacts WITH
    `the kind of application` IS `an application under regulation 34(1)(b), 36 or 37`
    `the first day of a week which is the subject of the application` IS YMD 2025 10 6
    `the date the application is received` IS YMD 2028 1 1
    `the last day of any further time that the Secretary of State or the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs consider reasonable in the circumstances` IS JUST (YMD 2027 12 31)

`week in 2025, received in time though a further time of 1 Jan 2027 was allowed` MEANS ApplicationTimeFacts WITH
    `the kind of application` IS `an application under regulation 34(1)(b), 36 or 37`
    `the first day of a week which is the subject of the application` IS YMD 2025 10 6
    `the date the application is received` IS YMD 2027 3 1
    `the last day of any further time that the Secretary of State or the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs consider reasonable in the circumstances` IS JUST (YMD 2027 1 1)

