    `the first day of a week which is the subject of the application` IS YMD 2026 4 5
    `the date the application is received` IS YMD 2027 4 5
    `the last day of any further time that the Secretary of State or the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs consider reasonable in the circumstances` IS NOTHING

